{"3448430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Origament: A Paper Adventure", "steam_appid": 3448430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/d580abd1f61bf087c3d51eb2597c2720.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/da68e5bad9ee817448c7fdae78679677.poster.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/da68e5bad9ee817448c7fdae78679677.webm?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/da68e5bad9ee817448c7fdae78679677.mp4?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure platformer where a precious letter journeys across time and continents in search of the one still waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world tells a unique story, and each quest reveals a clue to the greater secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a quiet moonlit garden to raging tornadoes in the Wild West - what a journey for a tiny piece of paper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the letter? That’s you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/50eb4bb73cebb8e3547def54577e6337.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origament is your escape after a long day - a lighthearted, joyful adventure where gameplay can be relaxing yet sometimes test your skills. With light puzzles, chill quests, stunning views, and a mysterious story, it’s less about the challenge and more about enjoying the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/54234658260af84369c6e5bcf3fe98fc.poster.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/54234658260af84369c6e5bcf3fe98fc.webm?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/54234658260af84369c6e5bcf3fe98fc.mp4?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/defec655e081af5f840ab33b8294dd79.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a paper boat drifting down a quiet stream. A paper plane gliding over the rooftops of old Venice. Or a paper shuriken smashing stalactites to send your mine cart racing ahead. Some worlds feel like meditation, others like wild journeys full of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/64d954724b5131fd8528eb151dc896d3.poster.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/64d954724b5131fd8528eb151dc896d3.webm?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/64d954724b5131fd8528eb151dc896d3.mp4?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/738b137c71480ac4ca55816069b92417.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=134 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level opens a new era, a new place, a new mood. The challenge doesn’t come from enemies, but from the environment and its clever puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/a4179bb2b6ee20cac53546c6d2dd4c37.poster.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/a4179bb2b6ee20cac53546c6d2dd4c37.webm?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/a4179bb2b6ee20cac53546c6d2dd4c37.mp4?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/1dc21474c31924cc3fe5c8e3cfb0f3df.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change form to overcome obstacles. Every transformation means new physics, abilities, and vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3b97248603670e233fd3e0fa9a2ab4f6.poster.avif?t=1786704512\" width=922 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3b97248603670e233fd3e0fa9a2ab4f6.webm?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3b97248603670e233fd3e0fa9a2ab4f6.mp4?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/54a73286283531e130d977cb974bd584.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not about combat - it’s about curiosity, observation, and clever adaptation. The levels themselves become both your biggest challenge - and your greatest ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/b8f77826cc8be5a23547ee57c6a09f57.poster.avif?t=1786704512\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/b8f77826cc8be5a23547ee57c6a09f57.webm?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/b8f77826cc8be5a23547ee57c6a09f57.mp4?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/717c0d5a62a9507e80e353e7612e23e4.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all began in the Archive of Memory - a place of fading thoughts, unsent words, and letters that were never read. <br>Forgotten, but not lost, they sleep in endless drawers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them was one special letter. No one remembers who wrote it anymore, but inside was a strange spark. Enough for the paper to tremble… and awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That same night, a Time Glitch flared up - and the letter vanished from the Archive. <br>Not stolen - escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere out there, the addressee is still waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/d580abd1f61bf087c3d51eb2597c2720.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/da68e5bad9ee817448c7fdae78679677.poster.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/da68e5bad9ee817448c7fdae78679677.webm?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/da68e5bad9ee817448c7fdae78679677.mp4?t=1786704512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure platformer where a precious letter journeys across time and continents in search of the one still waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world tells a unique story, and each quest reveals a clue to the greater secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a quiet moonlit garden to raging tornadoes in the Wild West - what a journey for a tiny piece of paper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the letter? That’s you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/50eb4bb73cebb8e3547def54577e6337.avif?t=1786704512\" width=1560 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origament is your escape a