e paper to tremble… and awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That same night, a Time Glitch flared up - and the letter vanished from the Archive. <br>Not stolen - escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere out there, the addressee is still waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "✉️ Become a living letter and find your way to the one who still waits for you! Fly, sail, roll, solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and travel through time and continents in this adventure platformer!😸", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Traditional Chinese, French", "reviews": "“A relaxing treat for the senses.”<br>80 – Entertainment Focus<br><br>“A great game for casual puzzle players who want something fun but not too challenging.”<br>Screen Hype<br><br>“Every transformation requires a good amount of prep and momentum, rendering Origament as one of the most original origami platformers.”<br>Mirror<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/b38ff7154161ee1d6cbf70fe75e489e173bb5454/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1786704512", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/8366ce9297a2f15ae14214cf662a5ea60db34ef4/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1786704512", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/8366ce9297a2f15ae14214cf662a5ea60db34ef4/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1786704512", "website": "https://spacesauce.studio/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6400 or AMD FX 8310<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><l